# Vector 5 - GET PROCESSING OPTIONS response, Format 1 (primitive 80)
# Published EMV / OpenSCDP sample. Synthetic; no live cardholder data.
# 80 is PRIMITIVE (bit 6 clear): six opaque octets, no recursion. By GPO Format 1 convention the
# value is AIP 1C00 + AFL 08010100 - the identical payload Vector 6 carries as self-describing TLV.
80 06 1C 00 08 01 01 00
